%%{init: {"theme": "default", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "13px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant API as API Service
    participant R as runTemplateImageJob
    participant J as image_jobs
    participant A as rootfs_artifacts
    participant D as template_definitions
    participant Dist as Distributor<br/>(进程内 channel)
    participant Rec as Reconciler<br/>(兜底)

    C->>API: POST /v1/templates
    API->>R: 启动后台任务 (jobID, req)

    R->>J: 写 status=Running phase=PULLING progress=5
    Note over R: preflight → pull image → 算 fingerprint
    R->>J: 写 phase=UNPACKING progress=20 + artifact_id
    R->>A: mkfs ext4 + 算 sha + 落 cbs

    alt mkfs / cbs 失败
        R->>A: cleanupFailedRootfsArtifact
        R->>J: 写 status=FAILED phase=BUILDING_EXT4
    else 成功
        R->>J: 写 phase=Built progress=70 (新)
        R->>D: 写 status=def_BUILT (新状态)

        alt 写 def_BUILT 失败
            R->>J: 写 status=FAILED
        else 成功
            R->>Dist: OnTemplateBuilt(templateID, jobID)

            alt channel 满 / 投递失败
                Dist-->>Rec: fallbackEnqueue (reconciler 兜底)
                Note over Rec: 每 10min 扫 def_BUILT >30min 未分发
            else 投递成功
                Dist->>Dist: 异步 worker 取事件
            end

            R->>J: 写 status=Built (终态)
            Note over R,Dist: 模板中心段结束<br/>CubeMaster 段从 channel 接走 → 进入下发
        end
    end
